# Shared ESP32-S3 **16 MB (N16R8)** sdkconfig overlay — DIO, 80 MHz, plus the
# 16 MB partition table. Used by every 16 MB board target, not one vendor's:
#   * Hammer BC0x / DC0x — verified from the Hammer vendor corpus
#     (HAMMER_HARDWARE_MATRIX.md §6 "ESP32-S3, 16 MB flash, DIO, 80 MHz [V]").
#   * Lucky Miner LV06 / LV07 / LV08 — ESP32-S3 N16R8 (Lucky enablement wave
#     2026-07-27). EXPERIMENTAL: no Lucky hardware exists on any bench, so this
#     overlay is host/desk-derived and has never been flashed to a Lucky unit.
#
# Renamed from `sdkconfig.defaults.hammer-16mb` when the second 16 MB family
# arrived; that filename is kept as a working deprecated alias so any command
# line or doc still naming it keeps producing this exact layout.
#
# Usage (16 MB targets ONLY — never make this the default; 8 MB boards keep
# partitions.csv):
#   ESP_IDF_SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.defaults.16mb" \
#     CARGO_TARGET_DIR=C:/bt cargo build --release -p dcentaxe \
#     --no-default-features --features hammer-bc04
#
# Remember the  rule: changing sdkconfig requires deleting the build
# cache (rm -rf C:/bt) for CMake's autoconf.h to regenerate.
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_16MB=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHMODE_DIO=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHFREQ_80M=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="partitions-16mb.csv"
